              'https://gwern.net/doc/japan/poetry/zeami/1993-quinn.pdf',
              '<b>Kishotenketsu is a counterexample to a universal conflict rule, not a national shortcut.</b> Ki introduces, sho '
              'develops, ten turns through contrast or new perspective, and ketsu reconciles. A turn can reveal a social or ecological '
              'pressure without a villain. Yuan zaju adds another caution: musical form, role conventions and a principal singer are '
